  "execution": "Actual installed CRAN mgcv 1.9-4. Source constructors, gam fits and gam.fit3/gam.fit4 analytic derivative kernels run without replacing source algebra. All numerical data are frozen JSON. Ordinary tests use static captures and require no R or vendored sources.",
  "scope": [
    "Arbitrary finite dense/signed/fractional/constant rows; fixed, mixed and estimated underlying SPs; effective fixed-zero semantics; unused/dependent coordinates when fixed.",
    "Gaussian and Poisson source predictions, conditional/frequentist/unconditional prediction covariance, EDF, likelihood/AIC, source G$L/lsp0 and transported design/penalty operators.",
    "Shared one-hot and arbitrary map composition with ordinary smooths, including source gam.setup smooth-first L versus PP-first S/sp ordering.",
    "Two distinct parametric terms with local map-column offsets; coefficient/prediction/covariance persistence; coordinate-view transaction/cache invariants.",
    "Source first/second analytic REML derivatives for Gaussian/Poisson and joint theta/SP derivatives for NB/scat and theta/SP/scale for Tweedie; Gaussian GCV, Poisson UBRE and ordinary NCV score/gradient."
  ],
  "boundaries": [
    "Automatically initialized rank-deficient free maps are rejected: source initial.spg lm returns nonfinite starting values. Fixed unused/dependent coordinates remain accepted.",
    "EFS with a nonidentity effective paraPen map is guarded. Rectangular source maps fail; square source maps are accepted but efsudr ignores L/lsp0 and returns an unmapped fitted state inconsistent with exported mapped full.sp. Fixed mapped SPs without selection remain usable with the EFS spelling.",
    "Positive min_sp with nonidentity maps is guarded: source minimum penalties enter full penalty H, while the existing underlying-SP floor route cannot represent that composition. A square-map source acceptance capture records this as a current implementation boundary.",
    "General-family formula lists reject paraPen upstream, including multinom K=1; the flat source variant also fails. Mapped transformed-coefficient compositions remain explicitly unimplemented.",
    "Default rescaled gam.vcomp retains the existing paraPen metadata guard; gam.vcomp(rescale=False) is covered separately in mgcv_parametric_map_vcomp."
  ],
  "tolerances": "New fit/observable-covariance/EDF/SP parity 2e-7; direct analytic score/gradient/Hessian parity 2e-8; design and penalty transport 2e-10/2e-9. Existing one-hot tolerances unchanged.",
